<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36792" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξάνθ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, = foreg., <i><span class="en">
			Hp.
			<u>Aph.</u>
			3.20
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Ph.
			2.101
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Archig.
		</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
			Gal.
			12.468
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>growth of young
			hair,</i> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.972
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fading,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐ. τις τῆς προϋπαρχούσης ὀσμῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					6.15.2
				</span></i>
			 codd. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξανθ-ίζω</span></b> ,
				<i>deck as with flowers, paint in various colours,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες . . αἳ καθήμεθ᾽ ἐξηνεθισμέναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					43
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνωθεν ἐξηνθισμένον,</span> of
			a fish, <i><span class="en">
				Philem.
				79.6
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντοίᾳ κομμωτικῇ . . ἐξηνθισμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					7.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλέφας φοίνικι -ισμένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Max.Tyr.
					40.2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Med.
			, <i>gather flowers,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.661f
			</span></i>.</div>
